# Op2_AnimByCruiseY: a y cruise speed under 100 (ruling 5, 2), at its first call: $34(a3) = 0, so
# divs #100 gives 0 and the animation speed $36(a5) is 1. A real state: an object whose script runs
# this op before setting its y cruise speed (the motion block starts cleared: Obj_InitSpawned).

case slow
l a3 + $34 = 0
